{"content":[{"c":["MUPPIM"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["One of Benjamin’s 10 sons (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.46.21","r":"Gen.46.21","rawR":"Gen.46.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.46.21","value":"Gen.46.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 46:21"},"). He is elsewhere called Shephupham (",{"href":"?bref=Num.26.39","r":"Num.26.39","rawR":"Num.26.39","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.26.39","value":"Num.26.39"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 26:39"},") and Shuppim (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.7.12","r":"1Chr.7.12","rawR":"1Chr.7.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.7.12","value":"1Chr.7.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 7:12"},") and is perhaps identifiable with Shephuphan (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.5","r":"1Chr.8.5","rawR":"1Chr.8.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.5","value":"1Chr.8.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:5"},"). ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Shephupham_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Shephupham_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Shephupham_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Shephupham"},"."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Muppim","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 46:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.46.21","rawQueryValue":"Gen.46.21","sourceRefExact":"Gen.46.21"},{"anchorText":"Nm 26:39","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.26.39","rawQueryValue":"Num.26.39","sourceRefExact":"Num.26.39"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 7:12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.7.12","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.7.12","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.7.12"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.5","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.5","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.5"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"317de3a832e78cb547ff